 6. KNOWN BUGS / ISSUES
================================================================================
1. [FIXED] DoctorRegisterContoller assigned role 'admin' instead of 'doctor'.
2. [FIXED] Patient "book appointment" POST route had no auth middleware (now auth:sanctum).
3. [FIXED] DoctorAppointmentController now filters by doctor_id and enforces
   ownership (403 for non-owner).
4. [FIXED] Appointment->doctorProfile() now uses doctor_id foreign key.
5. [FIXED] DoctorProfile and Appointment now use SoftDeletes.
