   PhpParser\Comment\Doc (unused leftover).
7. LoginController returns HTTP 201 instead of 200 for successful login.
8. UpdateDoctorProfileRequest status rule is in:active,inactive,pending but the
   DoctorStatus enum values are pending/active/rejected/suspended/vacation/archived.
9. [FIXED] Route prefix '/doctor/doctor/...' duplication (now /api/v1/doctor/...).
10. Tests: AdminLoginTest fixed (now posts /api/v1/login); NewExampleTest is still a
    placeholder ('nigga').
11. [FIXED] Swagger docs now cover login, doctor/patient register, admin doctor routes,
    doctor profile/appointments, patient appointments.

